  "description": "On a starry night filled with quiet hopes, Charlotte Augusta meets a dashing prince who feels like a dream. But his consciousness has wandered from his body, leaving a spirit only she can see. Prince Leopold enlists Charlotte's help to discover where his physical form lies, and the two start to share secret late-night rendezvous. Slowly, feelings begin to blossom between them, but as they draw closer to the truth, the fragility of his link to the waking world becomes ever harder to ignore...\n\n(Source: Tapas)",
